1. Open the settings. In Setup, enter Field Service Mobile in Quick Find, then open Field Service Mobile Settings.
2. Record the Austria values. Open the Austria settings and take a screenshot of the current values.
3. Clone the Austria settings. Use the row action or the Clone button. If Clone isn't available, click New and copy the Austria values manually.
4. Name the new settings. Enter the Ireland name from the table above.
5. Change the Ireland values. Update only the fields listed in the table below, then save.
6. Assign the profile. Open the assignment option for the new settings, add the Ireland minimum access profile, then save. If the profile is already assigned to other settings, stop and contact the requester.
7. Check the result. Log in to the Field Service mobile app with an Ireland test user and confirm that the changed values apply.
